{
  "_info": "Whole conversations. Each message is run through respond() with the state left by the previous one. 'business' (optional) = salon settings for that conversation. 'appointment' (optional) = appointment the customer already has. 'expect' on a message checks that turn (intent, handover, or a piece of text the reply must contain). 'expected' checks the final state: appointment (service, date, time; null = none), pending (service, date, timeOfDay, time, detailIds) and lastQuestion, waitlist (number of entries) and lastWaitlist (fields of the last entry). Per turn, replyNot is a regex the reply must not match. Availability is the simulated calendar, so times are deterministic.",
